      "modifications": [
        "Converted the source COLLADA actor mesh and props to a self-contained glTF 2.0 binary with embedded PBR textures.",
        "Clipped underground foundation skirts at the source authored ground plane before fitting, preserving interpolated position, normal, UV0 and UV1 data. Removed source terrain decals and death/damage effects.",
        "Preserved the authored above-ground architecture and UV texture detail. Centered the above-ground geometry in XZ and fitted uniformly inside the existing construction plot with 0.7 m total footprint margin.",
        "Converted source specular maps to roughness. Used authored normal maps and AO maps where supplied. Kept materials opaque and nonmetallic.",
        "Compressed embedded textures to WebP at no more than 1024 px and quantized static geometry, without mesh simplification.",
        "Recoloured only saturated purple cloth regions in the base atlas to muted indigo, retaining their folds and gold insignia; masonry is unchanged."
      ],
